00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:40.510
To make the Mini Origami Boomerang

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:43.900
I'm gonna split the paper into four
equal sheets by taking the top edge of

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.740
the paper folding it down to the bottom
and then creasing along that edge then I

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:51.340
run my fingernail against it or if you
want you to use scissors but I'm going

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:54.940
to open it up and split the paper in
half just like that then I'm gonna once

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:58.270
again take the top edge and fold it down
to the bottom and then make a crease

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:02.350
along that edge and once again crease it
with my fingernail open it up and then

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:05.500
tear it in half and then I'm ready to
make the mini boomerang if you'd like to

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.920
make the regular size one you could hold
a piece of paper like this fold it in

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.489
half lengthwise and then you can make a
