00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:19.450
along using the same direction I'm going
to show you for the many one starting

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:23.590
out we're going to take the top edge and
fold it down to the bottom edge and try

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:28.390
to line up the edges as neatly as
possible because neatness and also sharp

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:33.010
creases is very important for this model.
Once you line up the edges then you can

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:37.870
crease all the way across and then once
again I like to just run my fingernail

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:41.830
