00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:30.000
the edge and the middle line.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.230
Then once
again make another sharp crease and the

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:34.930
reason that we left a little bit of
space is because we're going to

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:38.800
eventually fold these two edges together
and if they're too close you'll see that

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:42.670
